Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito arcade experience of Space Invaders, with inline CSS and JS.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SPACE INVADERS · 1978</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .cabinet {
            background: #111;
            border: 4px solid #444;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,200,255,0.2);
            padding: 20px 20px 25px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 780px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .bezel {
            background: #000;
            border: 2px solid #222;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 10px 10px;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #000;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            aspect-ratio: 640 / 720;
            border: 2px solid #333;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            cursor: none;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 18px;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 0 8px;
        }
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .arcade-btn {
            background: #222;
            border: 3px solid #555;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ddd;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00aaff33, inset 0 0 8px #fff3;
            transition: 0.05s;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .arcade-btn:active {
            background: #2a2a2a;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00aaff;
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        .arcade-btn.fire {
            background: #2a1a1a;
            border-color: #aa3333;
            color: #ff6666;
        }
        .info-panel {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            color: #7fc9ff;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }
        .info-panel span {
            min-width: 70px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer-note {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            margin-top: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .controls { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 12px; }
            .btn-group { justify-content: center; }
            .info-panel { font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 4px 12px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
    <div class="bezel">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="640" height="720"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
        <div class="btn-group">
            <div class="arcade-btn" id="leftBtn">←</div>
            <div class="arcade-btn fire" id="fireBtn">⨁</div>
            <div class="arcade-btn" id="rightBtn">→</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-panel">
            <span id="scoreDisplay">0000</span>
            <span id="livesDisplay">❤️❤️❤️</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-note">1978 TAIRO · SPACE INVADERS</div>
</div>

<script>
    (function() {
        // ---------- CANVAS ----------
        const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
        const w = 640, h = 720;
        // ---------- GAME STATE ----------
        // 1:1 original rules: 5 rows of 11 invaders, 2 bunkers, player 1, score, lives
        const ROWS = 5;
        const COLS = 11;
        const INVADER_WIDTH = 28;
        const INVADER_HEIGHT = 24;
        const PLAYER_WIDTH = 32;
        const PLAYER_HEIGHT = 20;
        const BUNKER_COUNT = 2; // original had 2 bunkers (left/right) but we keep 2 classic
        // positions: left bunker x=80, right bunker x=480 (center of bunker)
        // bunker size
        const BUNKER_W = 60;
        const BUNKER_H = 40;

        // game objects
        let player = { x: 304, y: 680, width: PLAYER_WIDTH, height: PLAYER_HEIGHT, speed: 4 };
        let invaders = [];
        let bunkers = [];
        let bullets = []; // player bullets
        let invaderBullets = [];
        let score = 0;
        let lives = 3;
        let gameOver = false;
        let winFlag = false;
        let frame = 0;
        let invaderDirection = 1; // 1 right, -1 left
        let invaderStep = 12; // pixels per move
        let invaderMoveCounter = 0;
        const INVADER_MOVE_DELAY = 10; // frames between moves
        let invaderShootTimer = 0;
        const INVADER_SHOOT_DELAY = 30; // frames between shots
        let playerBulletActive = false;
        let playerBulletY = -10;
        let playerBulletX = 0;
        const BULLET_SPEED = 8;
        const INVADER_BULLET_SPEED = 5;

        // input
        let leftPressed = false;
        let rightPressed = false;
        let firePressed = false;
        let fireCooldown = 0;

        // ---------- INIT ----------
        function resetGame() {
            // invaders
            invaders = [];
            for (let row = 0; row < ROWS; row++) {
                for (let col = 0; col < COLS; col++) {
                    invaders.push({
                        x: 80 + col * 40,
                        y: 40 + row * 32,
                        width: INVADER_WIDTH,
                        height: INVADER_HEIGHT,
                        alive: true,
                        row: row,
                        col: col,
                        frameOffset: (row * 2 + col) % 4
                    });
                }
            }
            // bunkers (2 classic)
            bunkers = [
                { x: 80, y: 580, width: BUNKER_W, height: BUNKER_H, health: 4 },
                { x: 480, y: 580, width: BUNKER_W, height: BUNKER_H, health: 4 }
            ];
            // player
            player.x = 304;
            player.y = 680;
            playerBulletActive = false;
            invaderBullets = [];
            bullets = [];
            score = 0;
            lives = 3;
            gameOver = false;
            winFlag = false;
            invaderDirection = 1;
            invaderMoveCounter = 0;
            invaderShootTimer = 0;
            fireCooldown = 0;
            updateUI();
        }

        // ---------- DRAWING (pixel perfect 1978 style) ----------
        function drawInvader(x, y, frame, row) {
            // classic 2-frame animation based on row parity
            const alt = (row % 2 === 0) ? (frame % 2) : (1 - (frame % 2));
            ctx.fillStyle = '#39ff14'; // neon green
            ctx.strokeStyle = '#000';
            ctx.lineWidth = 1;
            // body
            ctx.fillRect(x + 4, y + 4, 20, 16);
            // legs (alternate)
            if (alt === 0) {
                ctx.fillRect(x + 4, y + 20, 6, 6);
                ctx.fillRect(x + 18, y + 20, 6, 6);
            } else {
                ctx.fillRect(x + 8, y + 20, 6, 6);
                ctx.fillRect(x + 14, y + 20, 6, 6);
            }
            // eyes
            ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
            ctx.fillRect(x + 8, y + 8, 4, 4);
            ctx.fillRect(x + 16, y + 8, 4, 4);
            // antenna
            ctx.fillStyle = '#39ff14';
            ctx.fillRect(x + 12, y, 4, 4);
        }

        function drawPlayer(x, y) {
            ctx.fillStyle = '#00cc00';
            ctx.fillRect(x, y, PLAYER_WIDTH, PLAYER_HEIGHT);
            // cannon
            ctx.fillStyle = '#7f7f00';
            ctx.fillRect(x + 10, y - 6, 12, 6);
            // details
            ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
            ctx.fillRect(x + 4, y + 4, 6, 4);
            ctx.fillRect(x + 22, y + 4, 6, 4);
        }

        function drawBunker(bunker) {
            if (bunker.health <= 0) return;
            ctx.fillStyle = '#2a5a2a';
            ctx.fillRect(bunker.x, bunker.y, bunker.width, bunker.height);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#1e3a1e';
            ctx.fillRect(bunker.x + 4, bunker.y + 4, bunker.width - 8, bunker.height - 8);
            // damage
            if (bunker.health < 4) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.fillRect(bunker.x + 20, bunker.y + 10, 20, 20);
            }
        }

        function drawBullet(x, y, isPlayer) {
            if (isPlayer) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';
                ctx.fillRect(x, y, 4, 12);
            } else {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ff4444';
                ctx.fillRect(x, y, 4, 10);
            }
        }

        // ---------- UPDATE ----------
        function update() {
            if (gameOver || winFlag) return;

            // move player
            if (leftPressed && player.x > 20) player.x -= player.speed;
            if (rightPressed && player.x < 640 - 20 - PLAYER_WIDTH) player.x += player.speed;

            // fire
            if (firePressed && !playerBulletActive && fireCooldown === 0) {
                playerBulletActive = true;
                playerBulletX = player.x + PLAYER_WIDTH/2 - 2;
                playerBulletY = player.y - 10;
                fireCooldown = 20;
            }
            if (fireCooldown > 0) fireCooldown--;

            // move player bullet
            if (playerBulletActive) {
                playerBulletY -= BULLET_SPEED;
                // check collision with invaders
                for (let i = 0; i < invaders.length; i++) {
                    const inv = invaders[i];
                    if (!inv.alive) continue;
                    if (playerBulletX + 4 > inv.x && playerBulletX < inv.x + INVADER_WIDTH &&
                        playerBulletY + 12 > inv.y && playerBulletY < inv.y + INVADER_HEIGHT) {
                        inv.alive = false;
                        playerBulletActive = false;
                        score += 10;
                        updateUI();
                        // check win
                        if (invaders.every(inv => !inv.alive)) {
                            winFlag = true;
                        }
                        break;
                    }
                }
                // check bunker collision
                for (let b of bunkers) {
                    if (b.health > 0 && playerBulletX + 4 > b.x && playerBulletX < b.x + b.width &&
                        playerBulletY + 12 > b.y && playerBulletY < b.y + b.height) {
                        b.health--;
                        playerBulletActive = false;
                        break;
                    }
                }
                // out of screen
                if (playerBulletY < 0) playerBulletActive = false;
            }

            // move invaders (step every INVADER_MOVE_DELAY frames)
            invaderMoveCounter++;
            if (invaderMoveCounter >= INVADER_MOVE_DELAY) {
                invaderMoveCounter = 0;
                // check edge collision
                let edgeReach = false;
                for (let inv of invaders) {
                    if (!inv.alive) continue;
                    if (invaderDirection === 1 && inv.x + INVADER_WIDTH >= 640 - 20) edgeReach = true;
                    if (invaderDirection === -1 && inv.x <= 20) edgeReach = true;
                }
                if (edgeReach) {
                    // move down and reverse
                    for (let inv of invaders) {
                        if (!inv.alive) continue;
                        inv.y += 8;
                    }
                    invaderDirection *= -1;
                } else {
                    for (let inv of invaders) {
                        if (!inv.alive) continue;
                        inv.x += invaderDirection * invaderStep;
                    }
                }
            }

            // invader shooting
            invaderShootTimer++;
            if (invaderShootTimer >= INVADER_SHOOT_DELAY) {
                invaderShootTimer = 0;
                // pick random alive invader
                const aliveInvaders = invaders.filter(i => i.alive);
                if (aliveInvaders.length > 0) {
                    const randomInv = aliveInvaders[Math.floor(Math.random() * aliveInvaders.length)];
                    invaderBullets.push({
                        x: randomInv.x + INVADER_WIDTH/2 - 2,
                        y: randomInv.y + INVADER_HEIGHT,
                        speed: INVADER_BULLET_SPEED
                    });
                }
            }

            // move invader bullets
            for (let i = 0; i < invaderBullets.length; i++) {
                const b = invaderBullets[i];
                b.y += b.speed;
                // collision with player
                if (b.x + 4 > player.x && b.x < player.x + PLAYER_WIDTH &&
                    b.y + 10 > player.y && b.y < player.y + PLAYER_HEIGHT) {
                    lives--;
                    updateUI();
                    if (lives <= 0) {
                        gameOver = true;
                    } else {
                        // remove bullet
                        invaderBullets.splice(i, 1);
                        i--;
                        continue;
                    }
                }
                // collision with bunker
                for (let j = 0; j < bunkers.length; j++) {
                    const bunk = bunkers[j];
                    if (bunk.health > 0 && b.x + 4 > bunk.x && b.x < bunk.x + bunk.width &&
                        b.y + 10 > bunk.y && b.y < bunk.y + bunk.height) {
                        bunk.health--;
                        invaderBullets.splice(i, 1);
                        i--;
                        break;
                    }
                }
                // remove if off screen
                if (i >= 0 && b.y > 720) {
                    invaderBullets.splice(i, 1);
                    i--;
                }
            }

            // check if invaders reach player (game over)
            for (let inv of invaders) {
                if (inv.alive && inv.y + INVADER_HEIGHT >= player.y) {
                    gameOver = true;
                    break;
                }
            }
        }

        // ---------- DRAW ----------
        function draw() {
            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);
            // background stars
            ctx.fillStyle = '#111';
            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);
            for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#333';
                const sx = (i * 97) % w, sy = (i * 41) % h;
                ctx.fillRect(sx, sy, 2, 2);
            }

            // bunkers
            for (let b of bunkers) drawBunker(b);

            // invaders
            for (let inv of invaders) {
                if (inv.alive) drawInvader(inv.x, inv.y, frame, inv.row);
            }

            // player
            if (!gameOver && !winFlag) drawPlayer(player.x, player.y);

            // bullets
            if (playerBulletActive) drawBullet(playerBulletX, playerBulletY, true);
            for (let b of invaderBullets) drawBullet(b.x, b.y, false);

            // game over / win overlay
            if (gameOver) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.fillRect(0, 300, w, 80);
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ff3333';
                ctx.font = 'bold 44px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('GAME OVER', w/2, 360);
            } else if (winFlag) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.fillRect(0, 300, w, 80);
                ctx.fillStyle = '#33ff33';
                ctx.font = 'bold 44px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('YOU WIN!', w/2, 360);
            }
        }

        // ---------- UI UPDATE ----------
        function updateUI() {
            document.getElementById('scoreDisplay').textContent = String(score).padStart(4, '0');
            let hearts = '';
            for (let i = 0; i < lives; i++) hearts += '❤️';
            document.getElementById('livesDisplay').textContent = hearts || '💀';
        }

        // ---------- GAME LOOP ----------
        function gameLoop() {
            if (!gameOver && !winFlag) {
                update();
                frame++;
            }
            draw();
            requestAnimationFrame(gameLoop);
        }

        // ---------- INPUT ----------
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            const key = e.key;
            if (key === 'ArrowLeft' || key === 'a') leftPressed = true;
            if (key === 'ArrowRight' || key === 'd') rightPressed = true;
            if (key === ' ' || key === 'z' || key === 'x') {
                firePressed = true;
                e.preventDefault();
            }
        });
        document.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {
            const key = e.key;
            if (key === 'ArrowLeft' || key === 'a') leftPressed = false;
            if (key === 'ArrowRight' || key === 'd') rightPressed = false;
            if (key === ' ' || key === 'z' || key === 'x') firePressed = false;
        });

        // Buttons
        document.getElementById('leftBtn').addEventListener('mousedown', () => leftPressed = true);
        document.getElementById('leftBtn').addEventListener('mouseup', () => leftPressed = false);
        document.getElementById('leftBtn').addEventListener('mouseleave', () => leftPressed = false);
        document.getElementById('rightBtn').addEventListener('mousedown', () => rightPressed = true);
        document.getElementById('rightBtn').addEventListener('mouseup', () => rightPressed = false);
        document.getElementById('rightBtn').addEventListener('mouseleave', () => rightPressed = false);
        document.getElementById('fireBtn').addEventListener('mousedown', () => firePressed = true);
        document.getElementById('fireBtn').addEventListener('mouseup', () => firePressed = false);
        document.getElementById('fireBtn').addEventListener('mouseleave', () => firePressed = false);

        // restart on game over / win (press R or click restart)
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'r' || e.key === 'R') {
                resetGame();
                updateUI();
            }
        });
        // add restart hint
        const restartNote = document.createElement('div');
        restartNote.style.color = '#555';
        restartNote.style.fontSize = '0.7rem';
        restartNote.style.marginTop = '6px';
        restartNote.textContent = 'press R to restart';
        document.querySelector('.cabinet').appendChild(restartNote);

        // ---------- START ----------
        resetGame();
        updateUI();
        gameLoop();
    })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
### Gameplay & Design
This page captures the look and feel of the original arcade cabinet. Here's how it works:

- **Core Mechanics**: You control a laser base to defend against five rows of alien invaders. The invaders move side to side and descend, while you fire bolts to destroy them. The game ends when your lives are lost or the invaders reach your base.
- **Controls & Feedback**: Use the on-screen buttons or keyboard keys (←/→ to move, space/Z/X to fire). Your score and remaining lives are displayed in a classic panel. The game includes a two-frame animation for invaders and a simple bunker defense system.
- **Visual & Audio Style**: The design uses a pixelated green-on-black aesthetic with neon accents, mimicking the arcade's vector-like display. The game loop runs smoothly, and the interface provides clear feedback for hits, game over, and victory.
